Date: 20.11.2026

Description:
ImageFilteR is an R package for applying different color filters to images

The package allows users to:
Load images and convert them into bitmaps
Convert images into grayscale
Apply red, green and blue colour filters
Apply a cutoff filter based on grayscale intensity
Save the filtered images into a "results" folder

The package uses the "magick" package to read and save images
